# Build/test
# These are anchored on purpose. A bare `coverage/` also matched
# `config/coverage/` (the jurisdiction coverage manifest) and
# `apps/web/src/app/admin/coverage/` (the scorecard page), so both were silently
# untracked while every local check passed against files a clean checkout would
# not have had. Name the directories that actually hold tool output.
/coverage/
apps/web/coverage/
services/*/coverage/
dist/
build/

# Runtime artifacts
artifacts/
playwright-report/
test-results/
tmp/
